WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.417
Britain and

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:01.209
Greece are kind

00:00:01.209 --> 00:00:02.293
of fighting with each other

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:04.379
over these statues.

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:05.005
These are sculptures

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:06.381
that are 2000 years old

00:00:06.381 --> 00:00:08.091
and they're housed in the British Museum

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:08.633
in London

00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:09.759
Back in the 1800s,

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:11.136
a British lord took

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:13.013
these sculptures from Greece,

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.097
brought them to the UK.

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:16.057
Crucially, he did get permission

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:17.225
from the Ottoman Empire,

00:00:17.225 --> 00:00:19.310
which at the time did control Greece.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.021
But once Greece got their independence,

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:22.731
they asked for the statues back.

00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:24.274
And of course, Britain said “no.”

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:25.859
Fast forward to last week

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.152
when the Greek prime

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:29.070
minister said this on the BBC,

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:30.196
We feel that these sculptures

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:31.031
belong to Greece

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.115
and that they were essentially stolen.

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:33.074
And this pissed off

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:34.367
the British prime minister

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:35.160
so much

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.661
that he canceled his meeting

00:00:36.661 --> 00:00:38.163
with the Greek prime minister.

00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:39.456
But like, come on.

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:41.708
These statues are from Greece.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:42.375
There's literally

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:44.335
a place in the Parthenon

00:00:44.335 --> 00:00:45.920
that is dedicated to these statues

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.255
that's just sitting there blank,

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:48.048
waiting for them

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:49.632
to return to their rightful place

00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:50.800
But the British are just not

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:51.676
going to budge on this.

00:00:51.676 --> 00:00:52.802
They're like, “No, we stole these,

00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:53.928
and we're going to just keep them,

00:00:53.928 --> 00:00:54.429
like we did

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:55.096
with everything else

00:00:55.096 --> 00:00:56.806
that we've stolen from around the world.”

00:00:56.806 --> 00:00:58.767
If you want to better global politics,

00:00:58.767 --> 00:00:59.851
follow along for more.

